    "title": "Suite",
    "summary": "On Upper Ruins, the battle begins. Wyper shoots his bazooka. Zoro attacks Wyper. Holy, with Ohm riding on him, swings at Zoro. Gan Fall rushes at Ohm. Robin digs her way into the depths of the Shandia Ruins. Nola strikes Zoro. Zoro sees Chopper. Zoro runs into Ohm's iron cloud trap and gets angry. Robin continues through the ruins. The Bilkans chase Nami into the Upper Ruins. Gan Fall, Wyper, Zoro, Holy, Ohm, and Nola continue their fights. The chapter ends with Robin finding Shandora.",
