    "id": "wiki-chapter-724",
    "volume": 73,
    "number": 724,
    "title": "Law's Plan",
    "summary": "Sanji battles Doflamingo, but is soon defeated. Law intercedes before Doflamingo can perform the finishing blow, and instructs the Sunny crew to head to Zou with Momonosuke and Caesar. Fujitora attacks the Sunny with a floating battleship, but Law retaliates and causes the admiral to decide to turn back. Law then takes Giolla and confronts Doflamingo on the bridge to Green Bit, where he reveals that he has ended his alliance with the Straw Hats, as he intends for Kaidou to kill Doflamingo while he takes revenge for what the Shichibukai did 13 years ago,",
