    "title": "Repaying the Debt",
    "summary": "Luffy's laughter at Pica was enough to anger the colossus into attacking the Straw Hat with his fist, although he missed, the shockwave was enough to send Luffy and his team flying. When Luffy and his group had a rough landing in the town center, they were greeted by Cavendish who renounces his grudge against Luffy and shifts it towards Doflamingo instead. While they manage to leave the self-absorbed pirate to his delusions of grandeur, they were surrounded by all the top contenders of the colosseum block battles who all share the same goal of taking down Doflamingo and repaying their debt to god Usopp but are not united due to their pride and agendas. At the Toy House, the soldiers were looking for Luffy's corpse or lack thereof since there was no trace of him after Pica's attack, but they were suddenly attacked by a charging band of infamous fighters with Luffy leading the charge. Pica",
