    "title": "Elephant Climbing",
    "summary": "The Going Luffy-senpai docks alongside the Thousand Sunny, and Kanjuro draws a dragon to take them up the elephant's leg. At the Revolutionary Army's main base, Dragon looks over the news, while Koala reports that the weapons they stole from Dressrosa contained a rare steel, Liquor Iron Ore. Dragon then orders her to get Sabo, as he wanted to gather all the leaders of the Revolutionary Army. Meanwhile, Jesus Burgess calls Laffitte and Shiryu to report that he has found the Revolutionary Army's base.",
