    "title": "Ten Days Earlier",
    "summary": "Kin'emon and Kanjuro are back at the Thousand Sunny after failing to climb Zunesha's leg. Luffy's group is reunited with Brook, who apologizes for what happened to Sanji; it is revealed by Luffy and Zoro that Sanji had left the crew a note. Nami then explains how the Curly Hat Pirates managed to escape from Big Mom's ship after departing Dressrosa. Wanda then starts telling the story of how their country got attacked seventeen days ago by Jack.",
