    "title": "Let's Go See the Cat Viper",
    "summary": "The Straw Hat Pirates debate whether or not to rescue Sanji, but Zoro reminds them that they have angered Kaidou and it would be unwise to anger another Emperor. The Straw Hats meet the recovering Nekomamushi and Pekoms as Chopper struggles to get Nekomamushi to wear his bandages. Luffy asks Pekoms about Sanji's marriage, and Pekoms reveals that Big Mom and Sanji's father arranged the wedding and that Sanji's father is an infamous man in the Underworld and the Vinsmoke Family is a family of killers.",
