    "summary": "In the Mirro-World, Chopper and Carrot have taken Brûlée and Diesel captive, using them to search for the other members of the Sanji Retrieval Team. In the third floor courtyard of Whole Cake Chateau, Pedro and Baron Tamago continue their fight. Pedro recalls his last encounter with Tamago and Big Mom, including the death of former Nox Pirates crewmate Zepo, before slicing Tamago in half.",
