    "number": 925,
    "title": "Absence",
    "summary": "Perona discovers that Gecko Moria is alive and prepares to leave Kuraigana Island. Meanwhile, Moria raids one of the Blackbeard Pirates' islands to confront Blackbeard and look for the missing Absalom. However, he discovers that Absalom has been killed and Shiryu has taken his Devil Fruit power, and Blackbeard invites Moria to join him while revealing that Sabo and his group attempted to rescue Bartholomew Kuma during the Levely. At Wano Country, after a brief spar with Inuarashi, Ashura Doji heads off, declining to ally with the Kouzuki Family. Meanwhile, Jack meets with the other All-Stars of the Beasts Pirates, King and Queen, who reprimand him.",
