    "title": "Sparks of Rebellion",
    "summary": "The Straw Hats learn more about Tonoyasu, who has no prior connections to the Kouzuki Family but wishes to join the fight against Orochi. He was forced to sell his daughter, Toko, to the Flower Capital, but his kind actions to everyone in Ebisu Town have caused him to be considered a saint. In the Prisoner Mine, Hyougoro teaches Luffy about advancing his Armament Haki, and they are eventually left alone in the ring until morning while the Beasts Pirates retire for the night. Raizo and Caribou then arrive, and Hyougoro is encouraged upon reuniting with the former, saying that there are tens of thousands of prisoners who would ally themselves with the Kouzuki Family. Meanwhile, Big Mom's group enters Udon.",
