    "summary": "Sakazuki and Fujitora talk about the fate of the recently ousted Seven Warlords of the Sea while the other Marines discuss the recently formed alliance between Kaidou and Big Mom, with some worrying that Rocks has returned. Afterwards, they discuss Rocks and his crew, the Rocks Pirates, in which three of the Four Emperors have been members as well as a team-up between Garp and Roger to defeat them. Afterwards, Roger's and all the Emperors' bounties are revealed.",
