    "title": "Oden's Return",
    "summary": "After gaining the title of Pirate King, Gol D. Roger decided to disband his crew. Roger was the first to leave and the rest of the crew returned Kouzuki Oden to Wano Country. Oden reunited with his family and retainers. The retainers then told Oden about Kurozumi Orochi becoming shogun and how he had been oppressing the citizens with the aid of Kaidou. After hearing about how his family was threatened, Oden charged to the Flower Capital and confronted Orochi.",
