    "summary": "Law works with the Nine Red Scabbards to amend their invasion strategy, and they plan to sail to the back of the island in the Polar Tang while the other groups cause a distraction. As the alliance reaches Onigashima, Denjiro realizes that he did not warn them about the guards at the Torii Gate, but the guards are immediately beaten by the Straw Hats. The Straw Hats decide to celebrate Jinbe's arrival after beating their enemies, and in Kaidou's fortress, the Flying Six arrive to the Fire Festival.",
