    "title": "Army of One",
    "summary": "Upon witnessing Jack in his mammoth form overpower the Guardians and Musketeer Squad, Inuarashi and Nekomamushi transform into their Sulong forms and decide to face him. King orders the Tobiroppo to prevent anyone from pursuing Kaidou on the roof of the Skull Dome. The Straw Hats continue their battle against the Numbers, where Monkey D. Luffy goes into Gear 4. Meanwhile, X Drake is confronted by Queen and Who's-Who, who reveal that Drake is a traitor, having previously freed Law. During his escape, Drake encounters Luffy and requests to join his side.",
