    "volume": 98,
    "number": 991,
    "title": "Let Us Die!!!",
    "summary": "Luffy accepts X Drake joining the alliance, but Zoro, Franky, and Jinbe disagree. Following Usopp's attack pretending to be Nami, Ulti and Page One chase them. Apoo attacks Luffy and Sanji, calling Hatcha for battle. Franky tries to lure Hatcha out of the Skull Dome on Jinbe's suggestion. Meanwhile, Apoo threatens to call for the Numbers, but Zoro and Drake end their clash to attack him. However, Queen shoots unusual bullets at them with a gatling gun. Meanwhile, Inuarashi and Nekomamushi have defeated Jack, and Kaidou intervenes in the battle as he blasts fire from his mouth toward the Nine Red Scabbards. However, Kin'emon cuts through the fire and wounds Kaidou's face, and the Scabbards prepare to give their lives to bring down Kaidou.",
