    "id": "wiki-chapter-996",
    "volume": 99,
    "number": 996,
    "title": "Island of the Strongest",
    "summary": "Tama, alongside Komachiyo and Hihimaru, saves Usopp and Nami from Page One and Ulti. Yamato continues fighting against Sasaki to protect Momonosuke and Shinobu; the fight is about to escalate when Franky rushes in, being chased by Hatcha. Hatcha smashes a hole in the floor, allowing Momonosuke, Shinobu, and Yamato to escape as Yamato launches an attack that takes down Hatcha. In different parts of the Skull Dome, Law is searching for the Road Poneglyph in hope of learning the truth about the mystery of the Will of D. Kid and Killer are making their way through the building to the roof where Kaidou is, gathering as many weapons as possible along the way. As Kaidou overwhelms the Nine Red Scabbards, Big Mom flies through the crowd towards the roof where he is.",
