    "title": "Anarchy in the B.M. (Big Mom)",
    "summary": "Ulti manages to withstand Nami's attacks and grab her, but before Nami can be pulverized, Big Mom combines Prometheus, Napoleon, and Hera to fire a powerful laser that knocks Ulti unconscious. Zeus then approaches Big Mom, but she tells him his services are no longer needed and tells Hera to consume his soul and grow stronger. Big Mom then attacks Nami, Usopp, and Tama as they flee from her, but Kid arrives and intercepts her, telling the Straw Hats to leave the Emperor to him. Meanwhile, Kaidou has defeated Luffy once again and has knocked the unconscious pirate clean off of Onigashima towards the sea, but the Emperor is left with regret that he did not ensure Luffy had died and thus take away the alliance's hope in him.",
