    "summary": "Ulti, who has regained consciousness, finds Nami, Usopp, and Tama and captures the latter. Zeus reveals that he has inhabited Nami's Clima-Tact, and she works on using him to attack the Tobiroppo. Usopp forces Ulti to release Tama by throwing a Pop Green, and Nami uses Zeus to finish Ulti off with a powerful thunderbolt. A nearby Bao Huang inadvertently reveals Ulti and Page One's defeats to the rest of the castle before being ensnared by Usopp, which allows Tama to use her Mary mask to broadcast herself to the tamed Gifters. On the Skull Dome roof, meanwhile, Kaidou and Yamato begin their clash.",
