    "title": "Cross Guild",
    "summary": "Inuarashi and Nekomamushi appoint Carrot as the next ruler of the Mokomo Dukedom as they intend on remaining in Wano to serve Momonosuke. As Sukiyaki reveals himself to his grandchildren, the Straw Hats discuss his revelation that Pluton is located in Wano; however, a spying Caribou overhears this and gets excited about revealing this as well as information about Poseidon to a certain person. A few days later, the Straw Hats and Yamato bid farewell to everyone except Momonosuke and Kin'emon, and the Straw Hats prepare to part ways with the Heart and Kid Pirates. Law gives Kid a rubbing of Kaidou's Road Poneglyph, and Kid reveals news about Dracule Mihawk and Crocodile working under Buggy to form the Cross Guild, which has issued bounties on Marines. Meanwhile, Yamato calls out to Momonosuke and Kin'emon from the roof of the shogun castle to announce his intention of joining the Straw Hat",
