    "title": "Punk Records",
    "summary": "When Bonney is surprised by Vegapunk's current appearance, the doctor reveals he ate the Nomi Nomi no Mi which grants him infinite knowledge and that the area known as Punk Records is where it is stored. As Vegapunk explains about his satellites, Bonney attempts to exact revenge but the weapon backfires on her. After talking to Luffy about Momonosuke's Devil Fruit, Vegapunk reveals the ancient giant robot attacked Mary Geoise 200 years ago. As Shaka explains to Sanji's group of how that robot's power source is unknown and cannot be reproduced, Vegapunk reveals to Luffy he has something to give to Bonney and asks Luffy to take him away from Egghead. When word about the arrival of CP0 is received, and they decide to eliminate Bonney as well once learning of her presence. Shaka then decides to prepare for battle. Meanwhile, at Momoiro Island, Kuma oddly starts to run away from the Revolutio",
