    "title": "All Things Are Brought into This World with Hope",
    "summary": "As CP0 and Luffy's group face each other, at Marine Headquarters, Sakazuki learns of the situation and orders CP0 not to engage them until backup arrives, while Rob Lucci reveals his new awakened form. Vegapunk joins Sanji's group at Labophase. As they watch the battle between Lucci and Luffy, who is using Gear 5, Vegapunk reveals to Sanji's group some of the truths about Devil Fruits in general, and Luffy's Devil Fruit—the Hito Hito no Mi, Model: Nika—in particular. Sentomaru arrives to command the Seraphim against CP0, forcing Lucci to take him out so CP0 could regain control over the Seraphim.",
