    "number": 1114,
    "title": "The Wings of Icarus",
    "summary": "Various people around the world are shocked by Dr. Vegapunk's message, to which at Impel Down Doflamingo believes that most cities will sink once the sea rises five more meters. The Five Elders decide to destroy any life form to stop the transmission. As Saturn reaches the Power Plant where the Mother Flame is stored, Vegapunk confirms that this problem is not natural and is his first sin. He then reveals his second sin was researching the Void Century and tells the world about Joy Boy who was the very first pirate, as Edison finishes his plan for the Thousand Sunny to leave Egghead.",
