    "title": "Inner Conflict",
    "summary": "As the world is shocked by Dr. Vegapunk's statement regarding the Ancient Weapons, he reveals the existence of the Mother Flame, the energy he created to power the world, and the fact that a portion of it was stolen. He then explains how the stolen portion was used to destroy the Lulusia Kingdom with an Ancient Weapon, and theorizes that when the day comes, the mystery of the Void Century will be revealed, revealing that only the Roger Pirates learned the truth. As York realizes he knew about her involvement in the Mother Flame theft, she realizes the Den Den Mushi that is transmitting the feed is on the Iron Giant and reports it to the Five Elders.",
