    "title": "Atlas",
    "summary": "In the past, it is revealed by Clover to Dr. Vegapunk that he is a D. and while Vegapunk initially refused to learn about the Void Century, he later decided to do so after he learned of Clover's death and Robin's survival in order to honor his friendship with Clover and Ohara's memory. In the present, as Vegapunk's message continues, Atlas knocks out Lilith and sacrifices herself so the Thousand Sunny can escape from Nusjuro. Meanwhile, the Iron Giant conveys a message to Luffy, as the other Elders decide to completely destroy it. Vegapunk then prepares to end his message as he states the twenty-five years ago, the Roger Pirates learned the true history.",
