    "number": 1135,
    "title": "Friends' Cups",
    "summary": "As the Straw Hat Pirates check out the library, they encounter a giant owl to whom Lilith realizes has a Devil Fruit power. Luffy and Usopp are disappointed while playing with the children, as the giant children are no longer being trained to fight. Luffy is attacked by Colon, and they learn he is a half-giant. As the Straw Hats separate, the two strangers attack some guards and demand Loki's location. Luffy's group then have a toast of sake cups in honor for everything the Straw Hats did for the giants in the past. Jarul then appears and Luffy is surprised by the sword stuck in his helmet.",
