    "title": "Mountain-Eater",
    "summary": "While traveling to the throne room, Luffy's group encounters a Magic Circle. A voice is then heard by everyone, causing Road to believe it is a ghost, causing him to drop everyone. It turns out to be Gaban, a former member of the Roger Pirates, as well as Ripley's partner and Colon's father. Gaban then learns about the group's mission, including that Luffy plans to defeat Loki if he got out of control, stating only Shanks could previously do it. As other members of the Straw Hat Pirates learn of Gaban's strength, Luffy's group succeeds in finding the key to Loki's chains, to which Gaban decides to challenge Luffy to a fight for possession of the key.",
