    "title": "One Second",
    "summary": "Gaban swiftly overpowers Sommers and decapitates the Knight at the shoulders which he does not regenerate from. Ange sets fire to the Walrus School while Killingham sets the Owl Library ablaze. As Gaban prepares to extinguish the blaze, Colon calls out to him, causing Gunko to go after the giant boy. Foreseeing that the attack on his son will be fatal, Gaban surrenders and Gunko strikes him with several arrows, sending him falling into the Underworld. However, Gunko is then overcome by a memory of her past concerning Brook, but as she heads toward him she is suddenly possessed by Imu.",
