    "number": 1157,
    "title": "Legendary Bar",
    "summary": "As the Rocks Pirates continue wreaking havoc on the seas, their notoriety only gets higher despite having been together for only two years. Rocks continues trying to recruit Harald to join his crew but Harald keeps turning him down in order to make Elbaph a member of the World Government, despite running into complications. Shakuyaku quits as the captain of the Kuja Pirates, which shocks the entire world. Shakuyaku then arrives on Hachinosu and sets up a bar on the island, with many of the pirates, even members of the Rocks Pirates, being enamored by her, and they allow her to stay. The Five Elders declare they are willing to allow Elbaph to be a member nation on one condition: the warriors of Elbaph must kill Rocks.",
