    "title": "The God Valley Incident",
    "summary": "After members of the Davy Family are revealed, the World Nobles begin the Native Hunting Competition to hunt down their targets throughout God Valley. The competition is disrupted by the arrival of the Rocks Pirates, Roger Pirates, and several other pirate ships. During the chaos, Dragon attempts to get Shanks and Shamrock off of God Valley. The Knights of God begin to take action and prepare for battle. While the Marines are being attacked, Garp and his fleet arrive to take on the pirates.",
