    "title": "Davy Blood",
    "summary": "Rocks resists his transformation and taunts Nerona Imu about Davy D. Jones and Joy Boy, which enrages Imu. Imu declares that he will subjugate Elbaph and Harald, much to Rocks' anger, and once again tells him to kill his family as Rocks' transformation completes. Rocks, in his demonic form, attacks Kaidou and Big Mom, and clashes with Whitebeard, destroying the mountain on God Valley. Rocks' nearly kills his own wife and son, but Kuma manages to teleport them and himself away from God Valley. Rocks kills several people till Garp and Roger confront him to stop him. They hear Rocks' voice, begging them to kill him.",
