    "number": 1168,
    "title": "The Snows of Elbaph",
    "summary": "Elbaph's reputation improves around the world as Giants join the Marines. Ida passes away on a snowy day. Loki was locked up for burning Brewers village and mourns Ida silently. Since Shanks went missing while completing a mission right before being promoted to a Knight of God, Harald is chosen instead. Harald meets Imu who grants him immortality and makes him a Knight of God. Imu orders Harald to form an army of Giant warriors for the Navy, which Harald refuses. Imu says as part of the Depths Covenant, Harald will receive immortality and power but must obey every order. Harald, realizing he is losing control, asks the guards to chain him to a pillar and call Loki and Jarul to Aurust Castle.",
