    "title": "Furious",
    "summary": "Zoro and the giants at the Western Village decimate the demonized giants with ease, while Chopper protects Kashii by punching one of the demonized giant using his Monster Point form, which inadvertently drives the demon away and restores the giant back to normal. Killingham is captured by the Straw Hats at the Owl Village as Luffy and Loki briefly reunite with them. Meanwhile, Usopp attempts to rescue Brook from Imu but is easily defeated. Though the resulting explosion draws the attention of Luffy and Loki who confront Imu, who remarks that the ensuring battle will inevitably divide the World.",
